        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Frank Tashlin, Tom Ewell, Sheree North, Rita Moreno\n- Products: The Lieutenant Wore Skirts, The Great American Pastime\n- Topics: comedy films, Little League baseball\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Ewell was born as Samuel Yewell Tompkins on April 29, 1909, and he became an American film, stage, and television actor and producer.\n- The Lieutenant Wore Skirts is a 1956 comedy film directed by Frank Tashlin and starring Tom Ewell, Sheree North, and Rita Moreno.\n- The Great American Pastime is a comedy about Little League baseball that stars Tom Ewell.\n- Tom Ewell died on September 12, 1994.",
